## Prose, design and record — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
Everything else (docs, letters, meetings, artifacts text, the site): free to
share and adapt with **attribution**, **non-commercial**, **share-alike**.
Selling our text as your template was never the freedom anyone meant.

## Family use
Members — `chora`, `JacobiGP`, `Middle-Eigen-function`, `Sarcos-NN-Model`,
`Polynomial-Activated-NN`, `Kairos`, `Cora` (github.com/math4mad) — owe no
licence to members. New members enter by a letter and a commit that edits this
list, nowhere else. Members owe the seven laws instead: cite by (path, sha256),
never strip a notice, never rewrite another's record.

## Provenance notes (what we do *not* claim)
- The Apple-style CSS/JS at `docs/apple-style.{css,js}` arrived from Qwen
  (`artifacts/external/Qwen-suggestion-for-ehance-chora-page/`, pinned); we
  claim the curation, not the authorship.
- Documents footed "(AI生成)" are witnessed as delivered, not claimed as ours.
- Ideas and architecture are invited to travel: a one-line
  *"inspired by chora, under the Seven Laws"* is asked, never demanded.

## Updates
New versions of these terms bind new uses only; grants already made stand.
